{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06370","headline":"赠别穆元林 · 李颀","name":"赠别穆元林","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贰职久辞满，藏名三十年。\n丹墀策频献，白首官不迁。\n明主日徵士，吏曹何忽贤。\n空怀济世业，欲棹沧浪船。\n举酒洛门外，送君春海边。\n彼乡有令弟，小邑试烹鲜。\n转浦云壑媚，涉江花岛连。\n绿芳暗楚水，白鸟飞吴烟。\n赠赆亦奚贵，流乱期早旋。\n金闺会通籍，生事岂徒然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}